<title>USA: Today's Man extends filing period for plan.</title>
<headline>Today's Man extends filing period for plan.</headline>
<dateline>MOORESTOWN, N.J. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Today's Man Inc said on Thursday it reached an agreement with its creditors' committee to extend the exclusive period during which it can file a proposed plan of reorganization to December 2, 1996.</p>
<p>Today's Man said it agreed to use its &quot;best efforts&quot; to attract third parties who may be interested in assisting it in a plan of reorganization.</p>
<p>The clothing store company filed for bankruptcy protection on February 2, 1996.</p>
